The contract contains a critical vulnerability in application deletion authorization.

### Vulnerability: Arbitrary Delete
### Explanation: The contract unconditionally allows any user to delete the application without verifying if they are the creator or authorized administrator. This allows malicious actors to permanently destroy the voting application and its state.
### Risk: Critical - Allows complete destruction of the application by any user, resulting in permanent loss of voting functionality and data.
